## ✅ Verification Checklist

Before publishing a news story:

- [ ] Open the original source.
- [ ] Verify the announcement and publication date.
- [ ] Write a concise summary in your own words.
- [ ] Explain why the development matters.
- [ ] Include a link to the original source.
- [ ] Check whether the story already exists in the archive.